{"unit_id":"tag:0EUC:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）的态射族（family of morphisms）。若对每个态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>是仿射的（affine），基变换（base changes）族<MATH_0004>组成有效的满态射（epimorphism），则<MATH_0005>组成的族在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）中是普遍有效的满态射（epimorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"满态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"满态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"态射所在的范畴；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"给定的族；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"用于检验的基变换态射；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"检验基底的假设；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"base changes","target_term":"基变换","context":"拉回得到的态射族；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"满态射","context":"有效性及普遍有效性在正文另保留；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"概形的范畴；译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0EUD:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是仿射概形（affine schemes）的态射族（family of morphisms）。假设引理<REF_0001>中等价的（equivalent）假设成立，而且对任意仿射概形（affines）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，映射（map）<MATH_0003>是拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间浸没的映射（map）（《拓扑（Topology）》一章定义<REF_0002>）。那么该态射族（family of morphisms）在概形（schemes）的范畴（category）中是普遍有效满态射（epimorphism）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价的"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"普遍有效满态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"给定的概形；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"给定的族；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价的","context":"引用引理的条件；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"基变换的概形；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"用于基变换的态射；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"族的并映射及其浸没性质；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"底拓扑空间；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"被引用的章名；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"结论所属的范畴；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"概形的范畴；译法待决。"},{"source_term":"epimorphism","target_term":"普遍有效满态射","context":"原文 universal effective 修饰的满态射；译法待决。"}],"notes":["remark: 原文 equivalent assumption ... hold 的语法疑似 typo；保留其所指的等价假设，未改动来源。"]}
